=head2 t

=over 4

=item C<tail>

From F<Loc.U>:

This variable is defined but not used by Configure.
The value is the empty string and is not useful.

=item C<tar>

From F<Loc.U>:

This variable is defined but not used by Configure.
The value is the empty string and is not useful.

